        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፴፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፪ ፤ ⟪ወነገረ ፡ መጽሐፍሰ ፡ ኀበ ፡ ያነብብ ፡ ከመዝ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይብል ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚደግመውም ፡ መጽሐፍ ፡ እንዲህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይል ፡ ነበር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪መጽአ ፡ ከመ ፡ በግዕ ፡ ይጠባሕ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ፡ በግ ፡ ሊሠዋ ፡ መጣ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወከመ ፡ በግዕ ፡ ዘኢይነብብ ፡ በቅድመ ፡ ዘይቀርፆ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በግ ፡ ጠጉሩን ፡ በሚሸልተው ፡ ፊት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከቀን ፡ ሐሩር ፡ ከሌሊት ፡ ቍር ፡ የምጠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በቅበትን ፡ ጠጉሬን ፡ በምን ፡ ዕዳዬ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ እንዳይል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከማሁ ፡ ኢከሠተ ፡ አፉሁ ፡ በሕማሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይዘው ፡ አስረው ፡ በገረፉት፡ ጊዜ፡ በምን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕዳዬ ፡ ነው ፡ አላለም ፡ የሚል ፡ ነው ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም፡በግ፡በሚያርደው፡ በሚአወራርደው፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፊት ፡ በምን ፡ ዕዳዬ ፡ ነው ፡ እንዳይል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይዘው ፡ አስረው ፡ ገርፈው ፡ ሰቅለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በገደሉት ፡ ጊዜ ፡ በምን ፡ ዕዳዬ ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አላለም ፡ የሚል ፡ ነበር ፡ ኢሳ ፡ ፶፫ ፡ ፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": "፴፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፫ ፤ ⟪ወተንሥአ ፡ እምኵነኔ ፡ ወእምነ ፡ ሞቅሕ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተነሥአ ፡ ማሠር ፡ መግረፍ ፡ መፍረድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መግደል ፡ ገንዘቡን ፡ ተቀማ ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተንሥአ ፡ ይዘው ፡ አስረው ፡ ሰቅለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከገደሉት ፡ በኋላ ፡ ሦስት ፡ መዓልት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሦስት ፡ ሌሊት ፡ በከርሠ ፡ መቃብር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አድሮ ፡ ተነሣ ፡ የሚል ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወመኑ ፡ ይነግር ፡ ልደቶ ፡ እስመ ፡ ተአተተ ፡ እም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድር ፡ ሕይወቱ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አነዋወሩ ፡ ከዚህ ፡ ዓለም ፡ ልዩ ፡ ነውና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምንም ፡ ልዩ ፡ ቢሆን ፡ ሰማያዊ ፡ ልደቱን፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማን ፡ ይነግራል ፡ ብለው ፡ (ማን ፡ ይመሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክራል ፡ ማለት ፡ ነው) ። አንድም ፡ ሕይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወቱ ፡ ነቢይ ፡ ሕይወቱ ፡ ሐዋርያ ፡ ከዚህ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓለም ፡ በሞት ፡ ተለይቷልና ፡ ምድራዊ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልደቱን ፡ ማን ፡ ይነግራል ፡ ብለው ፡ ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘው ፡ አስረው ፡ ሰቅለው ፡ በገደሉት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጊዜ ፡ በምን ፡ ዕዳዬ ፡ ነው ፡ አላለም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚል ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": "፴፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፬ ፤ ⟪ወተመይጠ ፡ ኀበ ፡ ፊልጶስ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ኅፅው ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያ ፡ ኅፅውም ፡ ወደ ፡ ፊልጶስ ፡ ተመልሶ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤሎ ፡ ብኵዐኒ ፡ ንግረኒ ፡ በእንተ ፡ መኑ ፡ ይብል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነቢይ ፡ ከመዝ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነቢይ ፡ ይህን ፡ የተናገረ ፡ ስለማን ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እስቲ ፡ በጅ ፡ በለኝ ፡ ንገረኝ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በእንተ ፡ ርእሱኑ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለ ፡ ራሱ ፡ ነውን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሚመ ፡ በእንተ ፡ ካልእ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወይስ ፡ ለሌላ ፡ አለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": "፴፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፭ ፤ ⟪ወከሠተ ፡ አፉሁ ፡ ፊልጶስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፊልጶስም ፡ ነገር ፡ ጀመረ ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡ ከሠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተ ፡ አፉሁ ፡ ጴጥሮስ ፡ ከሠተ ፡ አፉሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢዮብ ፡ እንዲል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአኀዘ ፡ ይምሀሮ ፡ በእንተ ፡ ኢየሱስ ፡ ወይፌክር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሎቱ ፡ በውእቱ ፡ መጽሐፍ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውእተ ፡ መጽሐፈ ፡ ሲል ፡ ነው ፡ ይህን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መጽሐፍ ፡ እየተረጐመ ፡ የጌታችን ፡ የኢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስን ፡ ነገር ፡ ይነግረው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጀመረ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": "፴፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፮ ፤ ⟪ወእንዘ ፡ የሐውሩ ፡ በጽሑ ፡ ኀበ ፡ ማይ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እየተረጐመ ፡ እየነገረው ፡ ሲሄዱ፡ ከውኃ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደረሱ ፡ እንዲህ ፡ እያልን ፡ ብናስተምር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብናጠምቅ ፡ ይከለክሉናል ፡ አለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
